        <h1>How to Merge PDFs <em>Without Uploading Them</em></h1>
        <p class="dek">Combining PDFs is simple, but nearly every online merger uploads your files to a server first. Here is how merging works, why the result can be bigger than the parts, what quietly gets dropped, and how to combine files on your own device with nothing uploaded.</p>
